        "hypr": "Defaults from `omarchy menu keybindings --print`. User overrides live in ~/.config/hypr/bindings.lua — flagged in rows.",
        "tmux": "Parsed from ~/.config/tmux/tmux.conf. Table is prefix, root (-n), or copy-mode-vi. Same key can exist in more than one table.",
        "herdr": "Parsed from ~/.config/herdr/config.toml [keys]. Combos are herdr names (ctrl+alt+left, prefix+q), not tmux C-M-Left.",
        "nvim": "User overlay at ~/.config/nvim/lua/config/keymaps.lua. LazyVim defaults are not listed; Add writes here.",
